{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415766","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415766","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041576601:1":{"text":"听着，皮帕，如果等会有守备军找了过来，你就说你没看见我！","source_cn":"听着，皮帕，如果等会有守备军找了过来，你就说你没看见我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CB575621DD9775D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041576602:1":{"text":"可是……撒谎是不对的，而且我只要一紧张，说话就会结结巴巴，肯定会被看穿的！","source_cn":"可是……撒谎是不对的，而且我只要一紧张，说话就会结结巴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92CE9D834A0F9CD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041576603:1":{"text":"要不……我用魔法把我们藏起来？虽然我上次想变一堵墙，结果变出了一群会跳舞的蘑菇……","source_cn":"要不……我用魔法把我们藏起来？虽然我上次想变一堵墙，结...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49D65279EF718ACF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041576604:1":{"text":"会跳舞的蘑菇？这不正好吗！说不定能把守备军吓跑呢！","source_cn":"会跳舞的蘑菇？这不正好吗！说不定能把守备军吓跑呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF0419DEE0F8D47E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041576605:1":{"text":"你的魔法真有意思，我怎么没想到能把我们变成蘑菇呢！","source_cn":"你的魔法真有意思，我怎么没想到能把我们变成蘑菇呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECFF2D8A25523325","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_mal